WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.007
Not every learning asset belongs only inside the course player.

2
00:00:04.007 --> 00:00:14.394
Job aids, checklists, worksheets, quick reference guides, policy summaries, lab guides, and printable handouts can support learners after the course is complete.

3
00:00:14.394 --> 00:00:22.853
These resources are especially valuable when the real task happens later, under time pressure, or away from the training environment.

4
00:00:22.853 --> 00:00:31.238
Tools such as InDesign, Acrobat, or similar document-production tools can support polished downloadable resources at a high level.

5
00:00:31.238 --> 00:00:33.834
The design should prioritize usability.

6
00:00:33.834 --> 00:00:38.583
A job aid should be easy to scan, easy to print when needed, and easy to update.

7
00:00:38.583 --> 00:00:43.554
It should not be a decorative brochure if the learner needs a working reference.

8
00:00:43.554 --> 00:00:45.929
Accessible document design matters.

9
00:00:45.929 --> 00:00:55.871
Use meaningful headings, readable text, logical structure, sufficient contrast, descriptive links, and alternative text planning for meaningful images.

10
00:00:55.871 --> 00:01:04.182
If a PDF is distributed, the team should consider whether it can be navigated and understood by learners using assistive technology.

11
00:01:04.182 --> 00:01:08.337
Accessibility is part of the asset, not an optional afterthought.

12
00:01:08.337 --> 00:01:13.827
Versioning is important for downloadable resources because learners may save copies.

13
00:01:13.827 --> 00:01:20.950
Include a clear title, date or version where appropriate, and ownership information if the organization uses it.

14
00:01:20.950 --> 00:01:28.370
Keep source files and export files organized so updates can be made without rebuilding the entire course from scratch.

15
00:01:28.370 --> 00:01:30.967
Align job aids with real workplace tasks.

16
00:01:30.967 --> 00:01:33.935
A good checklist supports a decision or action.

17
00:01:33.935 --> 00:01:36.681
A worksheet helps learners apply a process.

18
00:01:36.681 --> 00:01:41.578
A quick reference guide helps them remember steps without replaying a module.

19
00:01:41.578 --> 00:01:48.626
Downloadable resources are most valuable when they extend the course into the learner actual work environment.
